{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/LeoGuoLabs/status/2109836447528489047","id":"2109836447528489047","text":"Muse Wonder’s Japanese voxel world looks like it’s built out of marshmallows. 😂\n\nThe torii gate and floating island are recognizable, and there’s something charming about the pastel toy-world look. But the chunky shapes and sparse detail make it feel like a first draft.\n\nI’d want another pass before calling this a finished 3D scene.","raw_text":{"text":"Muse Wonder’s Japanese voxel world looks like it’s built out of marshmallows. 😂\n\nThe torii gate and floating island are recognizable, and there’s something charming about the pastel toy-world look. But the chunky shapes and sparse detail make it feel like a first draft.\n\nI’d want another pass before calling this a finished 3D scene.","display_text_range":[0,335],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"LeoGuoLabs","url":"https://x.com/LeoGuoLabs","id":"2089926964954144768","followers":9,"following":91,"likes":2,"media_count":77,"name":"Leo Guo","description":"Previously a senior C/C++ engineer in telecom. Now exploring AI and emerging tech, sharing useful tools and an engineering perspective.","raw_description":{"text":"Previously a senior C/C++ engineer in telecom. Now exploring AI and emerging tech, sharing useful tools and an engineering perspective.","facets":[]},"location":"Singapore, Hong Kong","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2089926964954144768/1791775643","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2089933102760214528/wgwr7axH_200x200.jpg","joined":"Wed Aug 19 04:18:29 +0000 2026","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":0,"retweets":0,"likes":0,"bookmarks":0,"quotes":0,"created_at":"Tue Oct 13 02:39:42 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1791859182,"views":3,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"q